		(uuid "2110e1f4-f9d3-4986-a925-e116d97f3601")
	)
	(text "USB 2.0 full speed, 5 V.\nR26/R27 5.1k on CC1/CC2 = sink.\nPB1/PB2 (ADC) read CC for the\nhost current limit:\n  0.25-0.61 V  default USB\n  0.70-1.16 V  1.5 A\n  1.31-2.04 V  3.0 A\n30 dBm TX (~650 mA from VBUS)\nneeds a 1.5 A USB-C host.\n\nU4 USBLC6-2SC6 ESD sits next\nto J12. D+/D- run straight to\nPA12/PA11; no series resistors.\nVBUS = (4.75, 5.0, 5.25) V @ (0.02, 0.1, 0.8) A"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92.71 55.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2650cbd8-6b4f-4fc8-aa78-fe2c00788c50")
	)
	(text "SPI1 + BUSY (PB9) + DIO1 IRQ (PB8).\nR11/R12 hold RXEN/TXEN low (PA and\nLNA off) until firmware drives them.\nR14/R15 DNP: pull-ups would back-power\nthe switched-off radio. TP1-TP7 DNP.\n\nRF_ANT: 50 Ohm microstrip, 0.36 mm F.Cu\nover In1 GND, 0.2104 mm er 4.5\n(JLC04161H-7628), no vias, >= 0.5 mm\npour gap. E22 VCC 2.5-5.5 V\n(>= 5.0 V for 30 dBm), TX 650 mA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 256.54 191.77 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2a365224-8988-4e24-a04a-b31feaad3e42")
	)
	(text "9  RESET AND LEDS"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 318.77 171.45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(thickness 0.3)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "386b6225-e6cc-4d5e-8951-40f91ab61a64")
	)
