	(text "TPS62085 (3 A) makes +3V3 from VBUS for the MCU,\nLEDs, J3 and pull-ups.\nVout = 0.8 V x (1 + R4/R3) = 3.32 V.\n+3V3 = (3.25, 3.32, 3.39) V @ (0.005, 0.04, 0.15) A"
